==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|de|Sturm|gloss=fast attack, assault|lit=storm}}. {{doublet|ru|шторм}}, borrowed from Dutch or Middle Low German.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-штурм.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|adj=штурмово́й}}

# {{lb|ru|military|or|figurative}} [[storm]], [[storming]] of something, [[assault]] {{gloss|fast, violent, often frontal attack}}
#: {{syn|ru|при́ступ}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[взять]] '''шту́рмом''' [[что́-либо]]|to take something '''by storm'''}}

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with '''[[шторм]]''', a storm as a weather event.

